**Read:** [Hybrid Symbolic-Numeric Framework — Cui, Li and Tomsovic](../sources/Hybrid-Symbolic-Numeric-Power-Models-Cui.lingua#r_7XTYA62FQ8W2X448XXVFNPA7AK), entire methodological and validation argument; [Convex relaxation of optimal power flow — Steven H. Low](../sources/Convex-Relaxation-of-OPF-Low.lingua#r_75K2XQST5PGBNZ7RJ41S3QW08B), both complete formulation/exactness papers; [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP), both complete physical-method studies and limits; [Research Roadmap on Grid-Forming Inverters](../sources/Grid-Forming-Inverters-Research-Roadmap.lingua#r_1XBSV4CPJGZG5FE56MH7507WAF), whole research/model/validation discussion.

Form a narrow question with a genuine unresolved modelling, measurement, design, maintenance or operating consequence. Read complete primary studies and substantial books, reconstruct the accepted methods and identify alternatives before proposing a contribution. Course completion supplies a foundation, not automatic research novelty or practical authority.

Reproduce an authorized published benchmark independently, then extend it through one justified change. Define evidence that could contradict the preferred explanation and compare numerical, parameter and structural uncertainty. Use appropriate physical/experimental evidence when the question requires it; a sophisticated simulation cannot by itself establish the behavior of an untested material, controller or installation.

Write a sustained scholarly argument with derivations, methods, results, limitations, competing explanations and revision after informed criticism. Preserve source/version/data provenance while keeping external books, papers, software/data collections and media outside this repository. A negative result, exposed non-identifiability or diagnosed failure can be a useful contribution. State how it changes the supported practical claim and what next measurement or derivation would resolve remaining uncertainty. Feed justified corrections back into the shared explanations and power-specific Records.

